  "description": "Beautiful Design\n\nThis bike is an absolute eye-catcher; It has a sleek and sporty design and is available in black and white, making it a very cool bike for your kids\n\nScope and Equipment\n\nThis bike comes with training wheels, hand brake, coaster brake, rear luggage rack, front and rear lights and reflectors; Ensure convenience and safety when your kids ride it\n\nOptimal Safety Protection\n\nAll our bikes are equipped with two independent braking systems, chain guard and handlebar edge guard to ensure the safety of your child\n\n90% Pre-assembly\n\nThe bikes are delivered 90% pre-assembled, you only need to carry out the simple assembly steps; The tools needed for assembly are included in the package\n\nFlexible and Adjustable\n\nThis bike can adjust the height of the seat over time to grow with your child.\n\nAbout Us\n\nHILAND had a simple yet powerful mission — to bring the joy of cycling and a healthy, positive lifestyle to everyone. From the very beginning, HILAND set out to provide affordable, high-quality bicycles that would make the freedom of riding accessible to all.\n\nWe've got our own manufacturing facilities, so we ensure that each bike we make brings top-notch performance and affordability to our amazing customers.\n\nRocket is a Hiland bike designed for children and prioritizes safety and comfort. The harmonious color scheme and simple streamlined frame make this bike both elegant and sporty, absolutely eye-catching. It is easy to handle and quick to pick up, contributing to foster children's self-confidence. Rocket makes learning to ride easy and fun, so that little riders will fall in love with cycling.",
